  "description": "A scene composed of a diverse collection of breads (loaves, rolls, sliced bread) and wheat stalks arranged on a wooden surface, visually representing a long history of bread consumption. The breads are positioned in overlapping layers, with some sliced to show texture, and wheat stalks placed centrally as a symbolic link to grain origins. The scene is overlaid with text that contrasts historical bread consumption with a modern health claim.",
